  "caption": {
    "hashtags": [],
    "public_preview": null,
    "text": "Sometimes the message you need most finds you at the exact right time. Not because everything is figured out, but because something within you is ready to hear it. \n\nYou are allowed to let go of what was not meant to stay. You are allowed to choose what feels right, what feels steady, what feels like peace instead of confusion. The right things in your life will not make you question your worth — they will remind you of it. \n\nWhere you are right now is not the end of your story. It is just a moment that is shaping you, softening you, and guiding you back to yourself. \n\nTake what you need. 🖤 Pages from the book ‘A Gentle Reminder’ by Bianca Sparacino 📖",
    "word_count": 122
  },
